<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f2f6fb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; }
  .wrapper { max-width: 620px; margin: 24px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5eaf2; }
  .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f6feb, #0e4fb5); padding: 28px 32px; color: #ffffff; }
  .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 23px; }
  .header p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #dbe9ff; }
  .content { padding: 30px 32px; }
  .content p { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .amount-box { background: #ecf4ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-left: 4px solid #1f6feb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 18px 0; }
  .amount-box .label { font-size: 12px; color: #1d4f91; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .6px; font-weight: 700; }
  .amount-box .value { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f4ea8; margin-top: 4px; }
  .context { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin: 18px 0; }
  .context table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .context td { padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8edf4; font-size: 14px; }
  .context tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .label { color: #64748b; }
  .value { color: #111827; font-weight: 600; text-align: right; }
  .notice { background: #fff7ed; border: 1px solid #fdba74; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 18px 0; color: #7c2d12; font-size: 14px; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; margin: 8px 10px 0 0; text-decoration: none; padding: 11px 18px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .btn-primary { background: #1f6feb; color: #ffffff !important; }
  .btn-secondary { background: #eef2f7; color: #0f172a !important; border: 1px solid #d9e2ef; }
  .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e8edf4; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Rent Due Tomorrow</h1>
    <p>RentIt Property Management &bull; Tenant Reminder</p>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Hi there,</p>
    <p>This is a polite reminder that your rent payment is due <strong>tomorrow</strong>. Please make payment on time to avoid late charges.</p>
    <div class="amount-box">
      <div class="label">Amount Due</div>
      <div class="value">{!Invoice__c.Total_Amount__c}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="context">
      <table>
        <tr><td class="label">Invoice Number</td><td class="value">{!Invoice__c.Name}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Due Date</td><td class="value">{!Invoice__c.Due_Date__c}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Billing Period</td><td class="value">{!Invoice__c.Period_Start__c} – {!Invoice__c.Period_End__c}</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="notice">To keep your account in good standing, please complete payment and submit evidence in the portal before the due date.</div>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{!$Label.RentIt_portalURL}/invoices?invoiceId={!Invoice__c.Id}">Pay / View Invoice</a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{!$Label.RentIt_portalURL}">Open Portal</a>
    <p>If you have already paid, please disregard this message.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    RentIt Property Management &bull; Automated email, please do not reply.
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>